Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `xs` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/ownership/write_window_requires_mutable_owner_or_write_parameter.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     edit: &xs[0]
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: A write window can change its owner, so the owner must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `xs := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
